From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:39:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Version 1.5.7

The 1.5.6 mugshot fix is field-confirmed; this release adds the
who-controls-what clarity copy (team-editor slots, Battle Style picks).
---
 Source/Core/UICommon/XDNetplay/Version.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Source/Core/UICommon/XDNetplay/Version.h b/Source/Core/UICommon/XDNetplay/Version.h
index bd3f03e..e7bd7c1 100644
--- a/Source/Core/UICommon/XDNetplay/Version.h
+++ b/Source/Core/UICommon/XDNetplay/Version.h
@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@ namespace XDNetplay
 // fork's release, so it cannot answer "which XD Netplay am I?" -- this constant is the only thing
 // that can. It MUST be bumped in the same patch that a release is tagged from: ship a tag ahead of
 // this string and every user of that release is told they are out of date forever.
-constexpr char VERSION[] = "1.5.6";
+constexpr char VERSION[] = "1.5.7";
 }  // namespace XDNetplay
